**Read:** [Non-ferrous Extractive Metallurgy — Ray and Pugazhenthy, NPTEL](../sources/Nonferrous-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_29G1ZF58Y8EG123MNX3ZRNRE2W), the complete aluminium and hydrometallurgical sequence; [Principles of Extractive Metallurgy — Tarun Kumar Kundu, NPTEL](../sources/Principles-of-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_7VCNEHN5VCQDDQTZ512PSHFZ78), all applicable solution extraction, thermal conversion, and metal-production discussions; [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), the entire relevant aluminium/alumina route and residual/utility account.

Bauxite and other aluminium-bearing feeds contain different minerals, impurities, physical associations, and variability. The chemical form of aluminium and accompanying silica/iron/titanium-bearing material matters to dissolution, reagent use, purification, precipitation, thermal conversion, and residue. Bulk aluminium content alone does not establish process suitability.

Reconstruct the full alumina route as connected solution, solid, heat, and reagent inventories. Distinguish dissolution, solution purification, aluminium-hydroxide precipitation, and conversion to alumina. Circulating liquor can accumulate or transform constituents, and a favorable local recovery can coexist with significant reagent, water, heat, or residue demands.

Connect product purity, particle properties, phases, and handling behavior with the receiving reduction cell. Residue is a material/chemical and water-management system with continuing responsibilities; recording only a residue mass does not characterize its long-term behavior or possible use.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete alumina case with feed mineralogy, stream compositions, methods, recycle, product evidence, and residuals. Independently check aluminium and a consequential impurity/reagent balance plus a defensible heat account. Compare a changed feed domain or purification arrangement against observed evidence. Explain which uncertainty controls the product or residue conclusion and design the investigation that could resolve it.

**Continue:** [Reconstruct aluminium electrolysis as a coupled material, electrical, and thermal system](Aluminium-electrolysis-anodes-bath-heat-and-product.lingua#r_03JS3JSTHRVNN500EZ8JQ11FG0).

